{"3262480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "JUMP! The Floor Is...", "steam_appid": 3262480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/1f2bfeb192b3e7f98e08a8faf6d665aa.poster.avif?t=1762357289\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/1f2bfeb192b3e7f98e08a8faf6d665aa.webm?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/1f2bfeb192b3e7f98e08a8faf6d665aa.mp4?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Welcome to <i><strong>JUMP! The floor is...</strong></i> the ultimate multiplayer showdown that will test your reflexes, strategy, and competitive spirit! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     In this exhilarating game, you and up to five other players must navigate a treacherous arena where the floor itself is your biggest threat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     The goal is simple yet challenging: be the first to reach the trophy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/e1791d585c25a7d8c26f88150fe1e2b5.poster.avif?t=1762357289\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/e1791d585c25a7d8c26f88150fe1e2b5.webm?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/e1791d585c25a7d8c26f88150fe1e2b5.mp4?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Power-UP System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The arena is filled with power-ups that can give you a temporary edge. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  These power-ups include increased speed, super jump, flight and others. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Each power-up lasts just 3 seconds, so you’ll need to use them wisely and strategically to gain an advantage over your competitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     The floor can turn into an array of deadly hazards, from <i><strong>explosive surface</strong></i><strong> </strong>and <i><strong>scorching lava</strong></i> to <i><strong>bouncy pads</strong></i>, <i><strong>moving sand</strong></i> and even the <i><strong>outer space</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Each map is designed with <i><strong>multiple paths</strong></i>, unique challenges and opportunities, offering players the freedom to find and choose their route to victory.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     But the challenges don’t stop there. The map is littered with <i><strong>traps</strong></i> designed to hinder your progress and test your agility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     From <i><strong>spike pits to moving platforms</strong></i>, every step you take could be your last chance to win the round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/75a4fe069528625ab5dd95a21d2e128c.poster.avif?t=1762357289\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/75a4fe069528625ab5dd95a21d2e128c.webm?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/75a4fe069528625ab5dd95a21d2e128c.mp4?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time Management and Abilities </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Each round is timed, pushing players to <strong><i>balance speed with strategy</i></strong>. The faster you complete your objective, the greater the rewards, but rushing can lead to costly mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Players have the ability to strategically throw <strong><i>bombs</i></strong> and plant <strong><i>mines</i></strong>, creating powerful disruptions to enemy tactics. <strong><i>Strategic placement and effective use</i></strong> of these abilities can turn the tide of battle in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/87351ac9c0dc5972525cf206a76dc0cf.poster.avif?t=1762357289\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/87351ac9c0dc5972525cf206a76dc0cf.webm?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/87351ac9c0dc5972525cf206a76dc0cf.mp4?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/a2b834448bb5d70f45d7935d9afa20ad.poster.avif?t=1762357289\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/a2b834448bb5d70f45d7935d9afa20ad.webm?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/a2b834448bb5d70f45d7935d9afa20ad.mp4?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     You'll need quick reflexes, sharp wits, and a keen sense of timing to navigate the dangerous terrain and outmaneuver your opponents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     The thrill of the chase, the excitement of close calls, and the satisfaction of a well-timed jump all come together to create an adrenaline-pumping experience that will keep you coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Get ready to leap, dodge, and outsmart your competitors in a game where the floor is never safe and every jump counts– let the jumping madness begin!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/1f2bfeb192b3e7f98e08a8faf6d665aa.poster.avif?t=1762357289\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/1f2bfeb192b3e7f98e08a8faf6d665aa.webm?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/1f2bfeb192b3e7f98e08a8faf6d665aa.mp4?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Welcome to <i><strong>JUMP! The floor is...</strong></i> the ultimate multiplayer showdown that will test your reflexes, strategy, and competitive spirit! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     In this exhilarating game, you and up to five other players must navigate a treacherous arena where the floor itself is your biggest threat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     The goal is simple yet challenging: be the first to reach the trophy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/e1791d585c25a7d8c26f88150fe1e2b5.poster.avif?t=1762357289\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/e1791d585c25a7d8c26f88150fe1e2b5.webm?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/e1791d585c25a7d8c26f88150fe1e2b5.mp4?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Power-UP System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The arena is filled with power-ups that can give you a temporary edge. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  These power-ups include increased speed, super jump, flight and others. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Each power-up lasts just 3 seconds, so you’ll need to use them wisely and strategically to gain an advantage over your competitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     The floor can turn into an array of deadly hazards, from <i><strong>explosive surface</strong></i><strong> </strong>and <i><strong>scorching lava</strong></i> to <i><strong>bouncy pads</strong></i>, <i><strong>moving sand</strong></i> and even the <i><strong>outer space</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Each map is designed with <i><strong>multiple paths</strong></i>, unique challenges and opportunities, offering players the freedom to find and choose their route to victory.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     But the challenges don’t stop there. The map is littered with <i><strong>traps</strong></i> designed to hinder your progress and test your agility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     From <i><strong>spike pits to moving platforms</strong></i>, every step you take could be your last chance to win the round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/75a4fe069528625ab5dd95a21d2e128c.poster.avif?t=1762357289\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/75a4fe069528625ab5dd95a21d2e128c.webm?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/75a4fe069528625ab5dd95a21d2e128c.mp4?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time Management and Abilities </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Each round is timed, pushing players to <strong><i>balance speed with strategy</i></strong>. The faster you complete your objective, the greater the rewards, but rushing can lead to costly mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Players have the ability to strategically throw <strong><i>bombs</i></strong> and plant <strong><i>mines</i></strong>, creating powerful disruptions to enemy tactics. <strong><i>Strategic placement and effective use</i></strong> of these abilities can turn the tide of battle in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/87351ac9c0dc5972525cf206a76dc0cf.poster.avif?t=1762357289\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/87351ac9c0dc5972525cf206a76dc0cf.webm?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/87351ac9c0dc5972525cf206a76dc0cf.mp4?t=1762357289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262480/extras/a2b834448bb5d70f45d7935d9afa20ad.poster.avif?t=1762357289\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\